---
layout: base.njk
title: Make software feel good
description: AtomicBytes builds web and mobile products that feel good to use—and hold up over time. Small-team energy, serious craft.
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <p class="hero-kicker">Independent studio</p>
      <h1>Make software feel good.</h1>
      <p class="lede">AtomicBytes builds web and mobile products that feel good to use—and hold up over time. Small-team energy, serious craft.</p>
      <div class="btn-group">
        <a href="mailto:hello@atomicbytes.com" class="btn btn-primary">Say hi →</a>
        <a href="{{ '/work/' | url }}" class="btn btn-secondary">See the work</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <img src="{{ '/assets/characters/atom-salesman.png' | url }}" alt="Atom Salesman, AtomicBytes mascot" class="hero-character" width="180">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-md">
  <div class="content">
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="card">
        <span class="card-label">builds & rebuilds</span>
        <h3 class="card-title">Web & mobile apps</h3>
        <p>New builds, rebuilds, hardening passes, and the unglamorous work that makes apps last.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="card">
        <span class="card-label">the last 10%</span>
        <h3 class="card-title">UI craft</h3>
        <p>Design-sensitive implementation, interaction polish, and that last 10% that people actually notice.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="card">
        <span class="card-label">stays fun</span>
        <h3 class="card-title">Performance & reliability</h3>
        <p>Speed, stability, observability, and maintainability—so the product stays fun to own.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="card">
        <span class="card-label">no surprise fridays</span>
        <h3 class="card-title">Shipping systems</h3>
        <p>Testing strategy, release process, and sensible automation to reduce "surprise Fridays."</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-md">
  <div class="content-narrow">
    <h2>Flexible by design</h2>
    <p>AtomicBytes is small on purpose. When a project needs extra range, we pull in trusted collaborators. No agency theater.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-md">
  <div class="content-narrow">
    <h2>About</h2>
    <p>AtomicBytes is an independent studio. We're not trying to be everything—just extremely good at building the right thing, keeping it simple, and shipping it with care.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-md">
  <div class="content">
    <h2>Blog</h2>
    <p class="lede">Notes from building. Topics will probably wander. That's the point.</p>
    
    {% set recentPosts = collections.posts | limit(3) %}
    {% if recentPosts.length > 0 %}
    <ul class="post-list">
      {% for post in recentPosts %}
      <li>
        <article class="post-card">
          <header class="post-header">
            <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}" class="post-meta">{{ post.date | dateDisplay }}</time>
            {% if post.data.humanMade %}
            <img src="{{ '/assets/labels/human-sticker.svg' | url }}" alt="Human Made" class="human-badge" width="48" height="48">
            {% endif %}
          </header>
          <h3 class="post-title"><a href="{{ post.url | url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
          <p class="post-excerpt">{{ post.data.description or (post.templateContent | excerpt) }}</p>
        </article>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p style="margin-top: var(--space-32);"><a href="{{ '/blog/' | url }}">All posts →</a></p>
    {% else %}
    <div class="empty-tray">
      <span class="empty-tray-label">ISSUE 00</span>
      <h3>First note coming soon</h3>
      <p>A magazine-shaped hole on purpose. Nothing invented to fill it.</p>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-lg">
  <div class="content-narrow" style="text-align: center;">
    <h2>Say hi</h2>
    <p class="lede">Email is best: <a href="mailto:hello@atomicbytes.com">hello@atomicbytes.com</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
